<title>USA: Raychem sees further currency impact.</title>
<headline>Raychem sees further currency impact.</headline>
<dateline>MENLO PARK, Calif. 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Raychem Corp said Wednesday that &quot;adverse movements &quot; in currency exchange rates lowered its third quarter net income by about $5 million, and are expected to &quot;continue exerting downward pressure on near-term results.&quot;</p>
<p>The company also said that expects to recover the costs of a $53 million restructuring through spending cuts over the next 18 to 24 months. The restructuring involved plant consolidation and the elimination of about 500 jobs.</p>
